flowchart TB
    accTitle: Single public error contract
    accDescr: Security, expected application, framework, and unexpected runtime failures converge on one RFC 9457 public error contract while unexpected details remain in structured internal logs.

    R[HTTP request] --> S{Spring Security accepts request?}
    S -->|No| SP[Security Problem Details adapter]
    S -->|Yes| C[Controller and application flow]

    C --> E{Failure category}
    E -->|Expected business| A[ApplicationException mapping]
    E -->|Request or framework| F[Framework mapping]
    E -->|Unexpected runtime| U[Sanitized 500 mapping]

    U --> L[Structured internal error log]
    A --> P[ProblemDetailsFactory]
    F --> P
    U --> P
    SP --> P
    P --> O[One RFC 9457 public error contract]

    classDef boundary fill:#EFF6FF,stroke:#2563EB,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef unexpected fill:#FEF2F2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#7F1D1D,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef output fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,color:#064E3B,stroke-width:2px;
    class U,L unexpected;
    class O output;
    class R,S,C,E,A,F,SP,P boundary;
